All symbolic identities verified: 
  * phi^2 = phi + 1, 1/phi = phi - 1, phi*(phi-1) = 1 
  * Minimal polynomial of phi:  x^2 - x - 1 
  * Norm of phi over Q(sqrt(5)) = -1  (phi is a unit) 
  * phi + psi = 1, phi*psi = -1  (Vieta) 
  * Fibonacci recursion: phi^n = F_n*phi + F_{n-1} 
  * Binet formula:  F_n = (phi^n - psi^n)/sqrt(5) 
  * Interior angle of pentagon: 3*pi/5 
  * Angular deficit (3 pents):  pi/5 
  * Angular excess (4 pents):   2*pi/5 
  * 10 pentagons accumulate 3 * 2*pi  -> spinor analogy 
  * Phi_5(x) = x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1 
  * Sum of all 5th roots = 0; sum of primitives = -1 
  * Gaussian periods = 2*cos(72), 2*cos(144) 
  * R72^5 = I exactly, det(R72) = 1, tr(R72) = 1/phi 
  * cos(36) = phi/2, cos(72) = 1/(2*phi) 
  * Z_2 holonomy: order 2  (spinor double cover) 
  * Z_n holonomy: order divides n (anyonic generalization) 
  * order(g, n) = n/gcd(g,n) for all g, n 
  * d_spec = 2 d_eff / d_w  (Alexander-Orbach) 
  * charpoly(C5) divisible by Phi_5(x)  (5-fold symmetry) 
  * C5^5 = I_5;  C5 . C5^T = I_5  (orthogonal cyclic shift) 
  * Cut-and-project projectors are idempotent, orthogonal, 
    and complete (P_diag + P_perp = I) 
  * Pentagon diagonal / side = phi 
  * Pentagon area = (1/4) sqrt(25 + 10 sqrt 5) 
  * Z[phi] integer multiplication verified 
  * Norm N(phi^n) = (-1)^n  (every phi^n is a unit) 
  * D_5 dihedral relations: S R S = R^{-1} 
  * |D_5| = 10, sum of irrep dims^2 = 10 
  * Star-cluster Laplacian: spectrum {0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 6} 
  * 5-regular OT CA family has 4096 rules 
